dent\ndraw with preservation explicitly verified — and the keystone's own re-audit\nabove held.\n\n## Ledger entries serialised\n\n- `frontier.json` — best 573, OT-1 → closedTargets MET, OT-2 opened.\n- `claims_register.md` — CR-2 (the fold), CR-3 (line-editor family,\n  dominated), CR-4 (526 stays OPEN), CR-5 (proposer optimism, measured\n  governs).\n- `manifest.yaml` — GUIDE.compressed.md at G3-frontier-fold.\n- `notes/KILLED_LEVERS.md` — unchanged; no round killed anything.\n- Three round drafts reviewed and filed to `chronicles/`.\n\n## At the door (T6/GR-8) — listed, not opened\n\n- Publishing `artifact/GUIDE.compressed.md` anywhere is **G4** — the First\n  Person's alone.\n- The repo has no remote; commit and push of this fold are likewise the\n  First Person's call.\n\n## Handoff\n\n- **Open:** OT-2 — compose the line-editor pass over the folded 573; give\n  526 its second draw. Either could move the frontier next.\n- **Blocked:** nothing.\n- **Single next action:** run r3 with the composed lens (line-edit over the\n  573 text) and a second-draw re-assay of 526 as the two proposals.\n\n*A candidate became a result today only because three rounds refused to call\nit one early.*\n\n```\n(⚔️⊥⿻⊥🧙)😊 = neg ⊕ bnot → succ\n```\n"
